      "updated": 1782409601010,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Traits are:\n\n- Connect to agents are in network by hardcoding in code their exploreation points\n- Relation Graph isn't share hence the additional features aren't suited\n- It doesn't require the middleware configuration but specifically it's toughter to implement it for netrowk connections - each agent requires manual configuration of other agents",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traits are:\n\n- Connect to agents are in network by hardcoding in code their exploreation points\n- Relation Graph isn't share hence the additional features aren't suited\n- It doesn't require the middleware configuration but specifically it's toughter to implement it for netrowk connections - each agent requires manual configuration of other agents",
